        "title": "Quick prompt palette, voice dictation, and reply branching land in chat",
        "summary": "Three composer- and shell-level features shipped together, expanding how users start, dictate, and fork conversations.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "A new Quick Prompt palette is wired into the Aura shell and menu bar, letting users draft a prompt from anywhere and hand it off to the active agent's composer via a shared quick-prompt store that merges into the existing draft.",
