              "da686ae7f755c5815f7af3ac9ae26a1dd4b74776"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Chat composer gains built-in voice dictation on both desktop and mobile, with a dedicated inline action slot in the input bar that reflows padding around the send/stop button so the mic never overlaps existing controls.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "914e2478d69e8ed508260d94fd8cf2cfa79140a5"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Any completed assistant reply can now be branched into a brand-new session: the server copies events through the selected message end into a fresh active session (leaving the original untouched) and the message actions menu exposes the new fork control.",
